# Verification Process

## Objective

Confirm the accuracy and reliability of collected information.

## Verification Workflow

### Source Validation

Review:

- Information Source
- Relevance
- Credibility

### Cross Verification

Compare findings against multiple sources where available.

### Documentation Review

Confirm evidence completeness and consistency.

## Quality Checks

- Accuracy
- Relevance
- Timeliness
- Documentation Standards

## Deliverables

- Verification Notes
- Investigation Confirmation
- Quality Review Summary
